<title>HONG KONG: ING Baring sets Pacific Plywood warrants.</title>
<headline>ING Baring sets Pacific Plywood warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Baring Financial Products said on Tuesday it intends to issue 200 million American-style call warrants on shares of Pacific Plywood Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>One warrant control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$2.525	PREMIUM	   27.5835 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.69648    GEARING	   3.6254x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  04.FEB.98     EXER LOT	  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG     LAUNCH DATE     04.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$2.525</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
